<title>HUNGARY: Hungary BUBOR rate up for 1mth, down for 3 and 6mth.</title>
<headline>Hungary BUBOR rate up for 1mth, down for 3 and 6mth.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) eased on Tuesday for the one- and the six-month maturities and rose for one month, the National Bank of Hungary said on.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 20.78 percent, up 0.01, the three-month rate at 20.60 percent, down 0.02 while the six-month rate was set at 20.20 percent, down 0.06.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
